- Negotiation and Moral Choice: Before anyone gets close, the station watch must switch off the lamps and warmed air in the maintenance hall and lower the shutter. Forcing a capture yields hydraulic fluid, tow cables, and knee bearings but costs maintenance engineers their safety. An Arc signal checker can switch the unit off. Fabricating a new support and sharing work approvals can finish the tow. People must choose an alternative to sacrificing another building''s column merely to reopen the blocked road quickly.
